Cell["\<\
The same quotients read as a ball, a sphere, a tube and a tube mantle: the \
probe moves the intercept and the factor of the slope.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"36d2617f-013e-4a09-a67d-9bbf2af7f5f2"],

